      "gloss": "to fold; to bend; to crease",
      "explanation": "To bend something by folding, typically paper, metal, or body parts like knees or fingers."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "07008_orimageru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{紙|かみ}を{半分|はんぶん}に{折|お}り{曲|ま}げた。",
      "english": "I folded the paper in half.",
      "notes": null,
